Z||000004||Standard||12-07-2000||12:33 PM||||I don't have a wing, but none of the snow on my rear deck moves until it starts melting... and then it just drips into the trunk and freezes on the tail lights..  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif"><P>As soon as I get a new decklid I think I'm going to put a wing on it.. mainly because my car was optioned with one and also because I've finally come to the conclusion that I really like how the wing looks on the fastback.  Something about the way the tips curl over the edges of the rear clip...<BR><P>------------------<BR>Mike -<BR>Black 86.5 GT 5 Spd, 153,000 miles and some busted up ground f/x  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/redface.gif"> <BR>Red 84 Sport Coupe - winter donut maker    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/asthanos.gif"> ||||reg||1
